WEBVTT

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.970
"Kansai"
"Kansai Station"

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.930
"Kansai Station"
"<i>Shinkansen </i>Platform"

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.100
Master! It already left!

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:22.270
To think they'd really raid
the <i>Shinkansen</i>. How interesting.

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:24.600
Shit! Damn Akudama!

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.560
There's still time till it
picks up speed. Let's go.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.970
Right!

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.680
"Akudama Drive"

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:03.310
The <i>Shinkansen</i>'s departure was unexpected,
but the raid was a success.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:06.270
"Shinkansen"
"Carriage 6: Freight Car 1"

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:06.270
The <i>Shinkansen</i>'s departure was unexpected,
but the raid was a success.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.520
The <i>Shinkansen</i>'s departure was unexpected,
but the raid was a success.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.020
But it's no longer going as planned!

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.310
We still haven't failed, right?

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:17.930
We're on the <i>Shinkansen</i>. If we take
the vault, the mission's a success.

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:20.470
So your plan accounted for this?

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:23.810
Having a plan doesn't guarantee success.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:27.720
However, we only have ten minutes left.

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:32.350
Any longer, and we'll plunge into the void
of doom--the Absolute Quarantine Zone.

00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:34.930
"Absolute Quarantine Zone"

00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:34.930
Any longer, and we'll plunge into the void
of doom--the Absolute Quarantine Zone.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:38.600
But knowing you guys,
that should be plenty of time.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:41.020
"6"

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:41.020
Hah! It's more than enough for me!

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:45.520
"6"

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:45.520
In any case, we're short on time.
Shouldn't we hurry to the vault?

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:50.220
I-I think I know what that is!

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:51.770
E-Executioners?!

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.430
Did they piece together our plans?

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:57.720
The huge power outage
couldn't have given it away.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.020
Your plan accounted for this, right?

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:00.930
It did not.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:01.890
What?!

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:04.890
Brawler and Cutthroat can eliminate them.

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:08.100
Stealing the vault is futile with them around.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.810
You talking to me? That was my plan all along!

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:12.520
I'd rather go with Swindler!

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.770
Huh?! At a time like this?!

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:17.180
Whatever. We're moving ahead.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.520
Hacker, open the next door.

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:23.020
Hacking the <i>Shinkansen</i>... Sounds fun!

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:25.970
Bring it on! I'm like a moth to a maim!

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.560
It's "like a moth to a flame," Bro!

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.770
Yeah! That one!

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:38.140
You're busted, Akudama.

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:39.520
Huh?!

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.180
This is gonna be fun!

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.470
I will execute you!

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:50.140
Tsk! You won't get away!

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:54.220
Looking away is a brawler's sin.

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:57.680
Wha--?!

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:03.100
Looking away is an Executioner's sin, too.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:05.520
It's time for a revenge match!

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:06.890
The weakling again?

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:09.020
I'll execute your face!

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:11.020
You're wide open!

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:15.520
And so are you! I knew you
wouldn't take me seriously!

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:17.720
It's open!

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.850
Courier, let's go!

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:22.640
Courier?

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:25.060
We need my bike for this job.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:26.350
Huh?

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:33.470
What are you doing, Courier? Hurry--

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:35.560
Wait, Mr. Black Cat.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:40.810
If Courier says we need his bike
for this job, I'm sure we do.

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:42.470
All right.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:48.520
"Shinkansen"
"Carriage 5: Freight Car 2"

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:48.520
So this is a freight car, too?

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.270
Damn Executioners!

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:52.310
If we don't get rid of them,
it's all for nothing!

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:53.970
"5"

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:53.970
If we don't get rid of them,
it's all for nothing!

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:56.520
"5"

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:56.520
Mr. Black Cat...

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.520
"5"

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.520
In any case, let's make our way to the vault!

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:02.720
That way, at least we accomplished something!

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:06.020
That's true. Swindler is right.

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.930
Let's keep going.

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:12.890
Snatching a vault in a worst-case
scenario... This could be fun.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:16.220
Which part of this is fun for you?!

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:21.060
Looking at your pretty face is way better
than fighting Executioners!

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:22.930
Mr. Cutthroat?

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:26.350
What are you saying?!
Stop the Executioners! You're a cutthroat!

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:30.100
Chill, lady. We don't know
what we're getting into.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.430
Better to have backup than not!

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:34.970
You're right about that, but--

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:44.970
Courier, huh? Without your bike,
you're just a punk.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:47.350
I never fail.

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:51.680
That is, no matter how shitty
the situation gets.

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:56.640
That dreadlocked gorilla! I'm gonna dissect him!

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:01.390
Stupid Pupil.

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:04.060
Doctors can be pretty useful.

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:07.430
But if I split you in two, can you heal that?

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:11.890
I've never been split in two before,
but I think I could manage.

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:15.180
But I know a guy who doesn't need doctors.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:22.350
I ain't gonna lose to some prick with a weapon!

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:30.100
I don't want to hear it
from a meathead like you.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:33.390
This one's more secure than the last one.

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.720
They don't want us to see
what's ahead? Interesting...

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.520
At this rate, we'll run out of time before--

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:48.060
The hell?! What was that?!

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:51.060
We left Kansai and it sped up.

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:55.520
In just five minutes, we'll enter
the Absolute Quarantine Zone.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:58.140
What?! We can't steal it in five minutes!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.770
We gotta try! We might as well since we're here!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.640
She's right.

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:03.640
--Does it matter if we're dead?!
--It won't be a problem if each of the four
doors takes an average of one minute.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:07.310
--We'll all be dead? But before I die,
I was hoping to kill you...
--It won't be a problem if each of the four
doors takes an average of one minute.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:07.680
--We'll all be dead? But before I die,
I was hoping to kill you...
--But assuming each door gets
progressively harder to hack,

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:11.640
--That's not funny! And by the way,
I don't see you doing anything useful!
--But assuming each door gets
progressively harder to hack,

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:12.220
--That's not funny! And by the way,
I don't see you doing anything useful!
--the last door should take...

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:14.930
--Hacker. What's taking so long?
--the last door should take...

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:19.810
This is the best time-limit game ever!

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:23.180
The greater the challenge, the greater the fun!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.270
Stay outta the way of my work!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.890
Hey, now. You hit one of your buddies.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.680
We're not buddies.

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:49.270
But I'll hit yours.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:58.310
You're mine, bro fro!

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:04.720
Let's get serious.

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.850
Mr. Brawler!

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:18.140
Ooh! It looks like a red sparkler!

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:19.520
It's open!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.430
Let's go!

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:24.310
Mr. Brawler! Are you okay?!

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:30.180
Executioner!

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:34.060
Wicked! Wicked-enough-to-make-
Brawler-spit-blood wicked!

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:36.720
What are you doing, Swindler?! There's no time!

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:38.970
But he's seriously gonna get killed!

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:40.770
Maybe I'll have a go?

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:41.890
Huh?

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:46.810
Because if you stay, he's gonna kill you.
And I wanna be useful...

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:50.390
Plus... I saw red blood!

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:52.970
Stay out of it.

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.930
This is my fight.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:59.020
Yo, Bro! Sorry you had to see me being so lame!

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:03.430
I'm gonna whoop his ass and
get 500,000,000 years like you!

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:06.600
Uh... Seriously?

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:12.060
I-I'm gonna whoop his ass, too, Bro!

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:14.560
Just wait till I get serious!

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.680
Seriously?! Hey, Executioner! You're dead!

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:19.100
Wha--?!

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:24.140
Plan to sleep forever, stupid Pupil?!

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:25.810
R-Right!

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.270
What is our duty?

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:30.100
To execute the dregs of society!

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:34.930
Then do your job! Those who can't
don't deserve the clothes!

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:36.060
Right!

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:38.270
You fit right in with those guys.

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:40.140
Shut your damn mouth.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:44.100
Give it your best shot
so I don't have to get serious, Bro.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:49.180
You sure? No take backs!
There might be nothing left of him!

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:51.430
Can't wait to see it!

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.520
But you just spewed blood.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:56.100
Those who can't fight should get lost.

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:56.640
Huh?

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:59.680
I'll slice anyone who threatens your life.

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:01.520
Let's go, Swindler!

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.810
Don't die, guys!

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:11.930
Three minutes until Absolute Quarantine Zone?

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:15.220
I'll kill you all with time to spare!

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:22.560
What dirty eyes.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:31.390
But since blood makes everyone equally pretty,
I'll make you bloom like a big, red flower!

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:34.720
Your 900 plus years wasn't for show.

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:37.640
This is...?

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:38.850
"Shinkansen"
"Carriage 4: Second-Class Passenger Car"

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:41.520
"Shinkansen"
"Carriage 4: Second-Class Passenger Car"

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:41.520
A passenger car, right?

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:44.390
For real? People ride on this, too?

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:48.310
It would seem that way. Let's continue.

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:56.270
It's open.

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:59.220
"Shinkansen"
"Carriage 3: First-Class Passenger Car"

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:01.520
This one's the same?

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:05.310
Then it's true. It must carry people to Kanto.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:10.890
I haven't heard rumors about it
carrying people. That's plain terrifying.

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:13.770
A while back, when I was
probing the Seal Center,

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:17.020
I discovered a profile of the <i>Shinkansen</i>.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:21.270
Digging deeper, it seemed
tied to seals from Kansai.

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:26.560
Huh? You mean, it's somehow connected
to people from Kansai?

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:29.600
Hmm. I've never come across anything like that.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:35.890
I wonder... I got blocked by their firewall
right after, so that's as far as I got.

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:41.020
But if there're passengers, that means
people have gone to Kanto before!

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:44.220
You're right. Why didn't I realize that?

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:49.180
At this rate, I'll make it to Kanto.
A utopia beyond compare...

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.810
I can finally say goodbye to crummy Kansai--

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.680
Utopia?! Far from it!

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:58.220
At this rate, we'll enter the
Absolute Quarantine Zone.

00:11:58.220 --> 00:11:59.970
Even if you survive that,

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:04.100
there's a Decontamination Zone
that purges organic matter.

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:06.600
Huh? Decontamination Zone?

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:10.680
Basically, if you reach Kanto,
you won't be alive.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:15.270
Mr. Black Cat... How much about
Kanto do you actually know?

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:19.020
That's something that doesn't concern you.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:22.600
Kanto...

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:33.430
Idiot! It's pretty obvious
you're after your bike!

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:36.810
Crushing Akudama scum
and crushing Akudama skulls...

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.930
...gives us Executioners pride!

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:42.810
Tsk!

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:51.060
My eyes! What the hell?!

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:52.100
What was that?

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:55.930
It's something like tear gas. Here.

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:59.350
It's about time you quit being a feminist.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.350
You shit!

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:06.560
Your cowardly tactics won't work on me!

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:10.600
In the end, putting women on top is how you win.

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:20.770
Sleight of hand?

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.390
I'll pull red out of your hat!

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:30.600
Don't dodge it! You'll ruin my trick!

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:34.850
Still, blood is so beautiful, don't you think?

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:39.770
Cutthroat is sick! With him around,
nothing's scary! Hmm?

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:43.890
I feel bad for my bro,
but I'll switch allegiances to--

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:50.560
Fear ain't a word in my dictionary!

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:55.020
And yet, I found myself shrinking back!

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.430
Unforgivable...

00:13:57.430 --> 00:14:01.560
It's unforgivable!

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:05.310
Outta the way, Cutthroat! This fight is mine!

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:09.140
Him and I are putting our lives on the line!

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:10.720
Whoa...

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:14.310
I'll show you the difference
between spunk and skill.

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.390
--I've figured out the control protocol.

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:17.180
--So fast! He'll have it open in a jiffy!
--I've figured out the control protocol.

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:18.970
--So fast! He'll have it open in a jiffy!
--It's a synchronized matrix with...

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.600
--It's too late.
--Huh?

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:23.140
It's the Absolute Quarantine Zone!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.970
Hello! Bunny here!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:36.100
'Sup?! It's Shark here!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:39.810
Shark, hey, Shark! You know about
the Absolute Quarantine Zone?

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.770
Nope! What's that?

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.890
Remember the war we talked about?

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:47.020
Yup! The one between Kanto and Kansai, right?

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:49.470
They dropped that huge bomb!

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:51.270
That's the one!

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.390
The new bomb ended the war!

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:57.810
But the ground, air, and water
were contaminated by the bomb...

00:14:57.810 --> 00:15:01.560
...and made the blast zone
into a total disaster!

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.890
And that's the Absolute Quarantine Zone?

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:08.180
Yup! It's an area between Kansai and Kanto!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:12.640
The <i>Shinkansen </i>has to go
through it to get to Kanto!

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:17.640
But, but! Wouldn't that mean
Kanto gets contaminated, too?!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:20.640
That's what Kanto's Decontamination Zone is for!

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:26.470
It sterilizes and breaks down the toxins
and organic matter that comes through!

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.680
Whoa! That's a relief!

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:33.560
Now leaving the Absolute Quarantine Zone
for the Decontamination Zone.

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:34.390
See?!

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:37.060
--You sure know your stuff, Bunny!
--Five, four, three, two, one...

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:40.270
--Five, four, three, two, one...

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:44.270
"The End"
"Produced by
Kansai"

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:49.770
Ouch!

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:52.770
I was so close, too! What just happened?!

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:56.810
We entered the Absolute Quarantine Zone.
There's no turning back.

00:15:56.810 --> 00:16:00.970
Huh? I thought we were dead
if we went into the zone.

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:03.970
Even if you take the vault,
you can't go outside.

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:06.350
All that awaits is the Decontamination Zone.

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:10.680
Once we enter that...
everyone here will die.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:15.020
Uh, so much for making it home safe and sound.

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:16.810
You phrased that oddly.

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:20.930
As if we have a chance if we finish before then.

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:23.180
Huh? Is that true?

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:24.720
Open the vault.

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:26.770
It's okay to open it?

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:30.640
It's fine. At this point,
there's not much choice.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:33.930
If you open the vault before then,
we'll work something out.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.640
Things just got interesting.

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.640
The game's back on!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:41.020
What the shit?! What happened?!

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:43.350
Watch the language, shithead.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:51.220
You <i>are </i>a feminist, aren't you?

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:53.850
I avoid killing outside of work.

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:58.850
But this <i>is </i>work. So?
What's your plan with the bike?

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:03.770
Ouchie! I hit my head!

00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:05.930
That hurt! I quit!

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:08.770
Tsk! Didn't expect that.

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:12.470
Hey, hey! We're in the Absolute Quarantine Zone!

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:15.270
It's too late to execute us now!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:20.140
Getting sat on like a horse...

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:22.560
...is a disgrace to my name!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:25.310
Brawler?!

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.520
Damn Executioners!

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.850
It's open!

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:33.060
Let's keep going! If we get past this,
it's the front carriage!

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:35.560
Move!

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:38.430
That was close!

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:39.680
"Shinkansen"
"Carriage 2: Security Room"

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:42.310
"Shinkansen"
"Carriage 2: Security Room"

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:42.310
The defense system at last, huh?

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:47.350
I see how it is. Time for the
big boss, huh? Bring it on!

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:51.810
Sorry, but I don't want to die either.

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:54.520
It's about time I finished the job!

00:17:57.600 --> 00:18:00.390
I said I'd put my life on the line.

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:17.060
This is... my win...!

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:20.930
Don't be so sure about that.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:26.140
Tsk! You scum!

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:32.640
Is this the bonus stage?!

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:33.850
Courier!

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:35.810
Get off. It's hard to steer.

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:40.430
Didn't you know it's easier to drive
with a woman aboard?

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.140
I'm riding, too!

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:45.640
You're all maggots of society!

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:51.060
I expected more from a boss!

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:58.890
Hacker! Help the others!

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:02.180
It's crane game time!

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:05.680
Tsk!

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:08.560
This is for you.

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.770
I can't breathe!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:28.720
Huh? What the--? What happened?

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:30.680
"To Kanto: 3 Minutes"

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:34.770
We're running out of time!
This is our last shot! Let's go!

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:38.020
"Shinkansen"
"Carriage 1: Vault Car"

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:39.310
"Shinkansen"
"Carriage 1: Vault Car"

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:39.310
Is that it?

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:41.810
How do we open this door?

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:44.100
Hacker! Open it up!

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:46.560
You love making me work.

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:54.560
So that's the vault?

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:55.060
"Locked"

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:55.060
It needs a seal to open it.
And a pretty special one at that.

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:56.890
It needs a seal to open it.
And a pretty special one at that.

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:59.930
"Locked"

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:59.930
It needs a seal to open it.
And a pretty special one at that.

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:01.890
"Locked"

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:01.890
Huh?! It won't open?!

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:07.310
Lemme try. I'll pry this baby
open with my fists. Argh...

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:08.270
Idiot.

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:09.270
Mr. Brawler!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.770
One minute until Decontamination Zone.

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:12.350
--Wh-What do we do?!

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.520
--One minute until Decontamination Zone.
--Wh-What do we do?!

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:18.140
Everyone... You've done well. Thank you.

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:19.430
Mr. Black Cat?

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:24.890
It's all right. The final piece
to open the vault... is me.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:26.140
Wait!

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:33.350
Huh?

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:35.430
This seal...

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:37.140
It opens up the vault!

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:38.310
Hurry, lady!

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:40.390
Huh?! R-Right!

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:47.640
Huh?

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:53.770
Ch-Children?!

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:57.720
Thank you. You've all done an excellent job.

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:08.600
We stopped?

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:12.220
Just like Black Cat said,
I guess things did work out.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:17.640
Who in the world are you guys?

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:51.270
All done.

00:22:51.270 --> 00:22:53.020
--Then I take it you guys
were our objective all along?

00:22:53.020 --> 00:22:54.350
--I'm all better now!
--Then I take it you guys
were our objective all along?

00:22:54.350 --> 00:22:55.770
--It's just first aid.
--Then I take it you guys
were our objective all along?

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:56.850
That's right.

00:22:56.850 --> 00:23:01.220
Um, I feel like you and Mr. Black Cat
have a similar voice.

00:23:01.220 --> 00:23:05.100
Of course we do. I'm the one who controlled him.

00:23:05.100 --> 00:23:07.140
Big Brother is smart.

00:23:07.140 --> 00:23:11.770
That makes things easy.
This means we finished the job, right?

00:23:11.770 --> 00:23:16.640
Hell yeah! I'm a frickin' billionaire!

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:22.850
Why are these little kids
being sent like goods to Kanto?

00:23:43.220 --> 00:23:47.020
These coordinates are
our destination--Expo Park.
